      "text": "Extracts durable concepts\nFilters slide noise\nAssigns domains and topics\n\nCriteria: \n1. Is it a meaningful standalone idea?\n2. Does it have a clear definition?\n3. Would a <domain> student revise this concept?\n4. Does it have technical depth, practical relevance, or interview\nvalue?\n5. Is it more than a generic word?\n\nOutput\nlecture.md + lecture.json",
      "originalText": "Extracts durable concepts\nFilters slide noise\nAssigns domains and topics\n\nCriteria: \n1. Is it a meaningful standalone idea?\n2. Does it have a clear definition?\n3. Would a <domain> student revise this concept?\n4. Does it have technical depth, practical relevance, or interview value?\n5. Is it more than a generic word?\n\nOutput\nlecture.md + lecture.json",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "isText": true,
      "fontStyle": "normal"
    },
