      "updated": 1784112890445,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deduplicates across courses\nSynthesizes one explanation\nPreserves source material and references\n\nKey components of a concept:\n1. Definition\n2. Why it Matters\n3. How it Works\n4. Real-world Applications\n5. Interview Questions\n6. Slide-derived Evidence\n*Others like mathematical foundation, advantages, limitations,\nprerequisites, related concepts, further reading...\n\nOutput\nconcept.md + metadata.json",
      "originalText": "Deduplicates across courses\nSynthesizes one explanation\nPreserves source material and references\n\nKey components of a concept:\n1. Definition\n2. Why it Matters\n3. How it Works\n4. Real-world Applications\n5. Interview Questions\n6. Slide-derived Evidence\n*Others like mathematical foundation, advantages, limitations, prerequisites, related concepts, further reading...\n\nOutput\nconcept.md + metadata.json",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
