    {
      "id": "text-056",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 108.95946943194497,
      "y": 1534.6448441415612,
      "width": 504.27582073478584,
      "height": 202.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#152033",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "at",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1056,
      "version": 870,
      "versionNonce": 1327284357,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784121159652,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PDF layouts and Optical Character Recognition (OCR)\ncan distort equations, tables, and diagrams.\n\nConcept filtering was too sparse, extracted a lot of\nnoise which created too many candidate \"concepts\".\n\nExtracted information across different slides were\ncombined and sometimes produced incoherent\nexplanations. ",
      "originalText": "PDF layouts and Optical Character Recognition (OCR) can distort equations, tables, and diagrams.\n\nConcept filtering was too sparse, extracted a lot of noise which created too many candidate \"concepts\".\n\nExtracted information across different slides were combined and sometimes produced incoherent explanations. ",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "isText": true,
      "fontStyle": "normal"
    },
