    },
    {
      "id": "text-059",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1250.455511235801,
      "y": 1515.7634568379704,
      "width": 1035,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#152033",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1059,
      "version": 879,
      "versionNonce": 290102763,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784119278354,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Refine concept content quality, design and readability.\n\nAutonomy slider: Let user decide how much of the content weight should be derived from the notes or LLM\ngenerated.\n\nEnsure scalability, that concepts don't become too cluttered when adding more courses into the knowledge base.\n\nIntroduce human review for uncertain concepts.\n\nImprove extraction across more varied course domains beyond technical fields.",
      "originalText": "Refine concept content quality, design and readability.\n\nAutonomy slider: Let user decide how much of the content weight should be derived from the notes or LLM generated.\n\nEnsure scalability, that concepts don't become too cluttered when adding more courses into the knowledge base.\n\nIntroduce human review for uncertain concepts.\n\nImprove extraction across more varied course domains beyond technical fields.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "isText": true,
      "fontStyle": "normal"
    },
    {
      "id": "l6fVG3aNHcf6GnvZt7kh9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 618.8483078412089,
      "y": 1513.6339492805928,
      "width": 562.6750406423201,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ax",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 75306123,
      "version": 1538,
      "versionNonce": 643629061,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784121146130,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Provide a direct hyperlink to view the referenced source\nmaterial, such as diagrams which cannot be reproduced in the\nconcept page.\n\nTightened the acceptance criteria, focus shifts to selecting\ndomain-relevant concepts instead of extracting all information.\n\nIntroduced LLM-as-a-judge to evaluate completeness, factual\naccuracy, hallucination risk, clarity, usefulness for revision /\ninterview preparation.",
      "originalText": "Provide a direct hyperlink to view the referenced source material, such as diagrams which cannot be reproduced in the concept page.\n\nTightened the acceptance criteria, focus shifts to selecting domain-relevant concepts instead of extracting all information.\n\nIntroduced LLM-as-a-judge to evaluate completeness, factual accuracy, hallucination risk, clarity, usefulness for revision / interview preparation.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "isText": true,
      "fontStyle": "normal"
    },
